| 5 | 2001 | 4.383566395256e-01 | 4.599805184135e-01 | 20 |
| 9 | 2001 | 1.045173911784e+00 | 2.046817048266e-01 | 72 |
| 11 | 2001 | 1.915643050219e+00 | 1.321964324367e-01 | 110 |
| 15 | 2001 | 7.194881107233e+00 | 5.350803943024e-02 | 210 |
| 21 | 2001 | 5.982230871073e+01 | 1.773723617054e-02 | 420 |
